{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-147-1","title":"Psalms 147:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The prophet exhorts to praise God for his care of the church; 4 his power and wisdom; 6 his mercy; 7 his providence; 12 to praise him for his blessings upon the kingdom; 15 for his power over the elements; 19 and for his ordinances in the church.</p>\n<p>for it is good. 63:3-5; 92:1; 135:3 and praise. 33:1; 42:4; 122:1-4; Re 5:9-14; 19:1-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-2","title":"Psalms 147:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>build. 51:18; 102:13-16; Ne 3:1-16; 7:4; Isa 14:32; 62:7; Jer 31:4; Da 9:25 Mt 16:18 he. 102:20-22; De 30:3; Ezr 2:64,65; 8:1-14; Isa 11:11,12; 27:13; 56:8 Jer 32:37; Eze 36:24-38; 37:21-28; 38:8; 39:27,28; Eph 2:12-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-3","title":"Psalms 147:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>healeth. 51:17; Job 5:18; Isa 57:15; 61:1; Jer 33:6; Ho 6:1,2; Mal 4:2 Lu 4:18 wounds. Heb. griefs. Isa 1:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-4","title":"Psalms 147:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>He. 8:3; 148:3; Ge 15:5; Isa 40:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-5","title":"Psalms 147:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Great. 48:1; 96:4; 99:2; 135:5; 145:3; 1Ch 16:25; Jer 10:6; 32:17-19 Na 1:3; Re 15:3 his understanding is infinite. Heb. of his understandingthere is no number. 40:5; 139:17,18; Isa 40:28; Ro 11:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-6","title":"Psalms 147:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>lifteth up. 25:9; 37:11; 145:14; 146:8,9; 149:4; 1Sa 2:8; Zep 2:3; Mt 5:5 Jas 4:10; 1Pe 3:4; 5:6 he casteth. 55:23; 73:18,19; 146:9; 2Pe 2:4-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-7","title":"Psalms 147:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>47:6,7; 68:32; 92:1-3; 95:1,2; 107:21,22; Ex 15:20,21; Re 5:8-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-8","title":"Psalms 147:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>covereth. 135:1; Ge 9:14; 1Ki 18:44,45; Job 26:8,9; 36:27-33; 38:24-27 Isa 5:6 prepareth. 65:9-13; 104:13,14; Job 5:10; Jer 14:22; Joe 2:23; Am 5:7,8 Mt 5:45; Ac 14:17; Jas 5:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-9","title":"Psalms 147:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>104:27,28; 136:25; 145:15,16; Job 38:41; Mt 6:26; Lu 12:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-10","title":"Psalms 147:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>delighteth. 20:7; 33:16-18; Job 39:19-25; Pr 21:31; Isa 31:1; Ho 1:7 he taketh. 1Sa 16:7; 2Sa 1:23; 2:18-23; Ec 9:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-11","title":"Psalms 147:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>taketh. 35:27; 149:4; Pr 11:20; 31:30; Isa 62:4; Zep 3:17; Mal 3:16,17 1Pe 3:4 fear. 33:18,22; 1Pe 1:13,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-12","title":"Psalms 147:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>praise thy God. 135:19-21; 146:10; 149:2; Isa 12:6; 52:7; Joe 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-13","title":"Psalms 147:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>he hath. 48:11-14; 51:18; 125:2; Ne 3:1-16; 6:1; 7:1; 12:30; La 2:8,9; 4:12 Da 9:25 blessed. 115:14,15; 128:3-6; 144:12; Isa 44:3-5; Jer 30:19,20; Zec 8:3-5 Lu 19:42-44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-14","title":"Psalms 147:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>He maketh peace, etc. Heb. Who maketh thy border peace. 29:11; 122:6; Le 26:6; 1Ch 22:9; Isa 9:6,7; 60:17,18; 66:12; Zec 9:8 filleth. 132:11; De 8:7,8; Eze 27:17 finest of the wheat. Heb. fat of wheat. 81:16; *marg: De 32:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-15","title":"Psalms 147:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>sendeth. 33:9; 107:20,25; Job 34:29; 37:12; Jon 1:4; Mt 8:8,9,13 his word. 68:11; 2Th 3:1; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-16","title":"Psalms 147:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>giveth. 148:8; Job 37:6; Isa 55:10 scattereth. Job 37:9,10; 38:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-17","title":"Psalms 147:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>casteth. 78:47,48; Ex 9:23-25; Jos 10:11; Job 38:22,23 who can stand. Job 38:29,30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-18","title":"Psalms 147:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>15; Job 6:16,17; 37:10,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-19","title":"Psalms 147:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>sheweth. 76:1; 78:5; 103:7; De 33:2-4; Mal 4:4; Ro 3:2; 9:4; 2Ti 3:15-17 word. Heb. words. Ex 20:1-21; De 4:12,13; *marg: De 5:22 his statutes. Ex 21:1-23:33; De 4:1,8,45; 5:31; 6:1; Mal 4:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-147-20","title":"Psalms 147:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":147,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":147,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>not dealt so. De 4:32-34; Pr 29:18; Isa 5:1-7; Mt 21:33-41; Ac 14:16; 26:27,18 Ro 3:1,2; Eph 2:12; 5:8; 1Pe 2:9,10</p>"}]}